   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\"Resume from the groove at the upload boundary, no fresh intro.\"\n\"Preserve the small repeating tonal motif and the call-and-response between\n solid low-end groove and busy, swirling drum fills.\"\n\"Let the original bass pulse return after percussion-led passages; develop into\n a focused driving peak, then finish with a long stripped DJ-mixable outro.\"\n\"No vocals, new dominant lead, trance breakdowns or festival drops.\"",
   "originalText": "\"Resume from the groove at the upload boundary, no fresh intro.\"\n\"Preserve the small repeating tonal motif and the call-and-response between\n solid low-end groove and busy, swirling drum fills.\"\n\"Let the original bass pulse return after percussion-led passages; develop into\n a focused driving peak, then finish with a long stripped DJ-mixable outro.\"\n\"No vocals, new dominant lead, trance breakdowns or festival drops.\"",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
